    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a casual VR game that brings a new immersive experience to players. The Communist Party of China has 4 exquisite scenes. Each scene shows the magnificent architecture of the Middle Ages and the beautiful natural scenery, making players seem to be in a charming fairy tale world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[img][/img] </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, players need to find girls hidden in various corners of the village based on hints. When players successfully locate all the girls in the scenario, a special dance feature will be unlocked. Players can enjoy the girls' unique dance performances. These dances are smooth and elegant, providing an audiovisual feast that immerses players further into the game's world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[img][/img] </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This casual VR game provides players with an opportunity to relax and explore beautiful scenes. In the process of looking for girls, players can feel the charm of the Middle Ages and enjoy their carefully arranged dance performances. Whether it is a game enthusiast or a player who experiences VR for the first time, you can find fun and enjoyment in this game. Come and join this charming medieval adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[img][/img]</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Operation method:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the girl in all Villages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you can unlock the dance level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk           left handle up/down/left/right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn           right handle left/right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset Position   left handle grip</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu          Handle menu key</p>",
